spice
* SPICE Netlist

V1 4 3 DC 3V     ; Voltage source from net 4 to net 3

I1 3 2 DC 1A     ; Current source from net 3 to net 2 (assuming 1A for demonstration)

M1 3 2 3 3 NMOS  ; Top NMOS transistor (drain 3, gate 2, source 3)
M2 3 2 3 3 NMOS  ; Bottom NMOS transistor (drain 3, gate 2, source 3)

.END